<title>BRAZIL: Brazil and Chad establish diplomatic ties.</title>
<headline>Brazil and Chad establish diplomatic ties.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil and Chad have established diplomatic ties, the Brazilian Foreign Ministry said.</p>
<p>The ministry said in a statement on Thursday that Brazil and the African country wanted to develop their already close and friendly relations and promote cooperation in areas of common interest.</p>
<p>It said they had agreed to exchange ambassadors.</p>
</text>
